   },
   "category": "家常菜",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "茄子去皮切段，放蒸锅里蒸5分钟，将盘中蒸出的水倒掉，这样茄子就不容易吸油了",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/4de09f74b7cc4fd2b388bda7f448b377_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "葱姜蒜切沫，小米辣切小段",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/27c950105dd843b4943e700863c244e6_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "按上面的配方把碗汁调好，以免待会儿手忙脚乱。生抽2勺+老抽半勺+蚝油1勺+陈醋1勺+白糖1茶勺+淀粉1勺+清水适量",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/a163985de3654342a3ea0863a92d3401_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "起锅烧油，倒葱姜蒜和辣椒翻炒出香味",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/86b3d8c0031e4ac0b7e2e3518d0c7943_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "肉沫倒进去翻炒至断生，沿锅边倒半圈料酒，激出香味，同时也能去肉腥",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/39d6389fe7ab46ffadc3696d7bb8adf6_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "倒入茄子翻炒两下",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/45a395145c3e4e59a24ace8bbd02aa42_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "沿锅边倒入调好的碗汁继续翻炒，尝下味道调咸淡，大火收汁",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/b53d6cf00e9349c3b19940f4bac2cbb7_1128w_1128h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "一盘下饭的肉沫茄子搞定啦!",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106398402-8.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9ed54b394e5a4904adacae0d20e8aa64_684w_684h.jpg"
     }
    }
   ]
