      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/322db175d83c4cb3833d7d17d369c7c0_1280w_959h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "备点葱段。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107735156-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/6f3553a69fe74989a0eb1ce48d1305ac_1280w_959h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "少许淀粉水。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107735156-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/0f0f42fabd8f4b23b78a2d471bdad13a_1280w_960h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "放点油，把鱼块煎至两面金黄。（先鱼皮向下煎，再用筷子轻轻翻面）",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107735156-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e5fe115b84da43f99ddb6694863ea077_1280w_960h.jpg"
