   "category": "主食面点",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "葱、姜、花椒放入小碗，倒入温水，用手揉搓下葱姜，这样更有利于去腥",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-1.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/264749d2a75e499296c24d82ad157bc7_3024w_4032h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "前腿肉绞打2次，选用3肥7瘦的部分",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/8341f22c272c4cbbbf07c3ed80efd5ab_3024w_4032h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "肉馅中加入14克盐、4克鸡精、3克胡椒粉、2克白糖，顺时针搅打均匀。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/bc80fc2d122341d299b293e828a94622_3024w_4032h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "将料水中的材料剔除，只加料水。将300毫升料水分三次加入肉馅中，每次顺时针搅打均匀。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/80cc3fa413e546c186eef27a0c340e13_1080w_1920h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "加入20克玉米淀粉，顺时针搅打均匀。加入2个蛋清，继续绞打均匀。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/5e51cd2391734ead88967d4189c8f08c_3024w_4032h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "加入60克玉米油，搅拌均匀，封住水分。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/7a46a5c5a62a4defb83812c40ac7efc2_3024w_4032h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "两斤肉馅大概可以包120个馄饨。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/106955464-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c3d42f0bd7374cddb13a143deff6e88c_2999w_2999h.jpg"
     }
    }
   ]
