   "image": {
    "local": "images/2026-11-21/107104018.jpg",
    "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/15f666e3aef54c50b3a443746e8777b8_1280w_854h.jpg"
   },
   "category": "烘焙甜点",
   "steps": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "提前一晚做波兰种，材料混合均匀室温30-60分钟，转冷藏一晚，待发到状态可用。",
     "image": null
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "面揉至光滑细腻可拉出均匀厚膜，面温22-24度为佳，最好不要超过26度。冷藏松弛半小时，分割滚圆，冷藏松弛20-30分钟。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-2.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/9fcd93161e3a4512a5e9c59a8da54c49_1920w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "整形1",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-3.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/6824d0387c454c32998078a37492fbe4_1920w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "整形2",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-4.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/280b33eb70e04e0d848d8b3177cd7e5f_1920w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "30-32度发酵约半小时至明显长大有气感。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-5.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/04a851e475ad46d28ae12081d038a509_1920w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "煮水，500水20糖煮至冒泡，两面各煮20秒，捞出控干水分后移到烤盘。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-6.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/cdb952e6a96f4e8ab500c630a93be695_1920w_2560h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "风炉，250度预热，入炉打蒸汽，转200度烤13-16分钟，中间看需要倒盘一下。",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-7.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/b62a603b8aa04efea5fe7e2f790d7834_1280w_854h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "出炉可以喷一点水，然后就愉快地唱歌了～",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-8.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/2f2b6a2816c941418f4786bcc3cd474d_1920w_1080h.jpg"
     }
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "凉透之后出了钻石裂纹",
     "image": {
      "local": "images/2026-11-21/steps/107104018-9.jpg",
      "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/faa2c21c46054dfdb32953864bff5447_1280w_854h.jpg"
